>Swanson</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Batirel</surname><given-names>HF</given-names></name><name><surname>Bueno</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Transthoracic esophagectomy with radical mediastinal and abdominal lymph node dissection and cervical esophagogastrostomy for esophageal carcinoma</article-title><source>Ann Thorac Surg</source><year>2001</year><volume>72</volume><issue>6</issue><fpage>1918</fpage><lpage>1924</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0003-4975(01)03203-9</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Swanson SJ, Batirel HF, Bueno R et al (2001) Transthoracic esophagectomy with radical mediastinal and abdominal lymph node dissection and cervical esophagogastrostomy for esophageal carcinoma. Ann Thorac Surg 72(6):1918&#x02013;1924. doi:10.1016/S0003-4975(01)03203-9 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11789772</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Johansson</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>DeMeester</surname><given-names>TR</given-names></name><name><surname>Hagen</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>En block vs transhiatal esophagectomy for stage T3 N1 adenocarcinoma of the distal esophagus</article-title><source>Arch Surg</source><year>2004</year><volume>139</volume><issue>6</issue><fpage>627</fpage><lpage>631</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/archsurg.139.6.627</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Johansson J, DeMeester TR, Hagen JA et al (2004) En block vs transhiatal esophagectomy for stage T3 N1 adenocarcinoma of the distal esophagus. Arch Surg 139(6):627&#x02013;631. doi:10.1001/archsurg.139.6.627 discussion 631&#x02013;3 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15197089</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR12"><label>12.</label><citation citation-typ